@startuml 03-work-shift-weekly-activity
' UC55 Manage Work Shifts - redesigned per teacher feedback:
'  - "+" button to add shifts (no longer fixed 3 shifts)
'  - shift hours stored PER WEEK: editing this week does not affect previous weeks
'  - no present / completed statistics (belongs to payroll)
title Manage Weekly Work Shifts

|Admin|
start
:Open "Work Shifts", choose a week (Monday - Sunday);

|System|
if (Week already has shifts in DB?) then (yes)
  :Show shifts of the week (work_shifts WHERE week_start = ?);
else (no)
  :Show empty state + "Copy from previous week" suggestion;
endif

|Admin|
split
  :Click "+" to add shift: enter shift name, start time, end time;
split again
  :Click "Edit" on a shift: change name / hours;
split again
  :Click "Delete" on a shift;
split again
  :Click "Copy from previous week";
end split

|System|
if (Selected week is in the past (week_start < current week)?) then (yes)
  :Reject: "Cannot change shifts of a past week";
  stop
endif
:Validate: shift name required, unique within the week,\ntime in HH:mm, end time after start time,\nno overlap with other shifts of the same week;
if (Deleting a shift that already has staff assigned (work_schedules)?) then (yes)
  :Reject: "Shift has schedules, remove them first";
  stop
endif
:Save to work_shifts only for the selected week_start\n(other weeks unchanged);
:Show success message, reload shifts of the week;
stop
@enduml
